9
00:00:19.274 --> 00:00:20.954
several fasteners working together.

10
00:00:21.194 --> 00:00:22.395
In a more complex connection,

11
00:00:22.555 --> 00:00:24.834
features such as the haunch and compression stiffener

12
00:00:24.834 --> 00:00:27.075
