13
00:00:27.395 --> 00:00:30.875
Pause at the illustrations and use the hotspots to identify the features shown.

14
00:00:31.274 --> 00:00:33.634
Keep this whole connection view in mind as we move on to the

15
00:00:33.634 --> 00:00:35.034
